        <obo:IAO_0000115>The mammalian blastocyst is a hollow ball of cells containing two cell types, the inner cell mass and the trophectoderm[GO].</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>Gilbert fig11.32 has blastocyst has giving rise to ICM and trophoblast (which in this source is a synonym for trophectoderm)</obo:IAO_0000116>
