        <owl:annotatedTarget>A gonad of a male animal. A gonad produces and releases sperm.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>http://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
