            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A pad of fibrocartilage between the articular surfaces of two successive vertebral centra which has nucleus pulposus at its core.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000008>strictly speaking the term intervertebral disk [applies to intervertebral cartilage]</obo:UBPROP_0000008>
