        <obo:IAO_0000115>Gelatinous mucoid tissue that is composed of vitreous humor and fills the cavity behind the crystalline lens of the eye and in front of the retina[MP,modified].</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>distinciton between body and humor requires more work. These may be merged in future. Note that FMA includes the hyaloid canal as part of the vitreous body</obo:IAO_0000116>
