        <obo:IAO_0000115>An external caudal extension of the body. In chordates, the tail is post-anal, in other animals the anus ends in the tail.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>Note we also have a subclass post-anal tail, for the chordate specific structure. currently defined very generally, inclusive of caudal fin</obo:IAO_0000116>
