        <owl:annotatedTarget>in BTO this is restricted to the 4th ventricle - however this class also represents the early ventricular zone as well as its post-natal remnants. The MA class is named &apos;ventricular zone of brain&apos; and is presumably restricted to the post-natal zone; DHBA class is forebrain; PBA class is neocortex; TAO/ZFA is neocortex</owl:annotatedTarget>
