        <obo:IAO_0000115>Upper portion of the skull that excludes the mandible (when present in the organism).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:RO_0002171 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0003278"/>
        <obo:RO_0002175 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_7762"/>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000007>cranial</obo:UBPROP_0000007>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000012>the inclusion of the FMA class here is probably not quite correct, as this class includes as parts sutures, whereas this is not part of the bones of the cranium</obo:UBPROP_0000012>
