        <obo:IAO_0000115>An epithelium that is part of a uterine cervix [Automatically generated definition].</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000010>The epithelium of the cervix is varied. The ectocervix (more distal, by the vagina) is composed of nonkeratinized stratified squamous epithelium. The endocervix (more proximal, within the uterus) is composed of simple columnar epithelium</obo:UBPROP_0000010>
