        <obo:IAO_0000115>Intrinsic membrane that arises from embryonic germ layers and grow to surround the developing embryo.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000008>stuctures homologous to the four extraembryonic membranes appear in mammals [ISBN:0073040584 (Vertebrates, Kardong)]</obo:UBPROP_0000008>
