        <obo:IAO_0000115>Lobular organ the parenchyma of which consists of glandular acini which communicate with the vestibule of vagina. Examples: right vestibular gland, lesser vestibular gland.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FMA:20020</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
