        <obo:UBPROP_0000008>apparently absent in polyprotodont species (Didelphidae, Dasyuridae, Thylacinidae, Notoryctidae, Peramelidae, and Caenolestidae); paired lobes found in diprotodont (Burramyidae, Petauridae, Phalangeridae, Phascolarctidae, and Tarsipedidae)[DOI:10.1071/ZO9730285]</obo:UBPROP_0000008>
        <oboInOwl:id>UBERON:0018244</oboInOwl:id>
